  <div class="journey-original-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Original FX user journey graphic. Scroll horizontally to explore on smaller screens.">
    <img src="/art/fx-journey-original.svg" width="985" height="750" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Dana Chen's FX execution journey: persona, scenario and goal; thoughts and feelings, emotional experience, effort and tool switching; approach and feedback loops; and five stages with descriptions and recommendations: pre-trade, staging the order, working passively, intervention and post-trade review." />
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .fx-original-journey{min-width:0;margin-block:64px 96px;scroll-margin-top:140px}
